title: The Emissary Asks Questions
subtitle: Moscow wants to know what has been done.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: directive_active = 1 and directive_envoy_seen = 0 and directive_deadline <= 1 and directive_compliance < 50 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and comintern_member = 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
Q.directive_envoy_seen = 1;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}

= The Emissary Asks Questions

[? if comintern_rep : [+ comintern_rep +] ?][? if comintern_rep = 0 : An emissary of the Executive, travelling as a fur trader from Reval, ?] has asked to attend the next meeting of the Zentrale. He has one question, and he asks it twice: what has the German section done about *[+ directive_title +]*?

The honest answer is: not much. The deadline is close.

- @show: Show him what we have done.
- @promise: Promise action before the deadline, and order it tonight.
- @door: Show him the door.

@show
subtitle: Works if there is something to show.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.directive_compliance >= 25) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.comply(15);
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    RG.ecci(Q.directive_from, -3);
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : We walk him through the reports from the districts. He writes a great deal down, and his telegram that evening is less severe than it might have been. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : There is very little to show, and he can count. ?]

@promise
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The districts get urgent orders. Moscow sees effort.
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_moscow_orders == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
RG.comply(20);
Q.unity -= 2;
!}

Circulars go out to every district that night, marked urgent. The district secretaries grumble that the Zentrale has discovered the directive a week before it is due.

@door
subtitle: Our independence grows. Moscow will hear exactly how it was done.
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence += 4;
RG.ecci(Q.directive_from, -8);
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 3;
!}

The Zentrale thanks the emissary for his interest and asks him to leave the meeting, since he is not a member of it. He leaves.
